; editorplace.eval - `editor place` hangs a wall kind on the VIEWED level's
; first FREE face (code-review C449). Judged by tools/EditorTest.py phase 28,
; on its scratch world.
;
; With no face named, a wall-mounted brush took the first solid face of the
; ACTIVE map at that square, taken or not, while the brush edits the level being
; VIEWED - so on a browsed level, or where that face already held one, the
; placement was refused. Now the face comes from the viewed map's
; FreeSconceWall / FreeNicheWall (MapEditor::DefaultWallFace). eval_arena is
; open floor from 1,1 to 26,22, so at every crypt1 square below but 5,1 the old
; pick found no wall at all, and at 5,1 it found eval_arena's north rock - the
; very face crypt1's own sconce holds.
;
;   --- active ---    eval_arena 1,1, a corner: a sconce named onto north, then
;                     one with no face - north is taken, so west.
;   --- taken ---     crypt1, browsed: a sconce at 5,1, whose first solid face
;                     (north) holds crypt1's own sconce - south (east is open).
;   --- plain ---     a sconce at 2,7: north, its first solid face, free.
;   --- niches ---    a niche at 12,5 (rock east and west) three times: east,
;                     west, then refused - no free face, never a taken one.
;   --- full ---      a sconce at 4,3, whose one solid face holds crypt1's other
;                     sconce: refused.
;   --- erased ---    `editor erase` rebuilds the browsed snapshot too, as a
;                     middle-click does: 13,5 (the rock east of 12,5) takes the
;                     east niche, and a niche at 12,5 takes east again; 5,1 takes
;                     its first sconce (crypt1's own, north), and a sconce there
;                     takes north again. On a stale snapshot both faces of each
;                     still read taken and both placements are refused.
;   --- end ---       after savemap; the judge reads both levels' files.

logecho on
reset
editor
echo --- active ---
editor place fixtures sconce 1 1 north
editor place fixtures sconce 1 1
levels view crypt1
echo --- taken ---
editor place fixtures sconce 5 1
echo --- plain ---
editor place fixtures sconce 2 7
echo --- niches ---
editor place wallfeatures niche 12 5
editor place wallfeatures niche 12 5
expect-refuse editor place wallfeatures niche 12 5
echo --- full ---
expect-refuse editor place fixtures sconce 4 3
echo --- erased ---
editor erase 13 5
editor place wallfeatures niche 12 5
editor erase 5 1
editor place fixtures sconce 5 1
levels view eval_arena
savemap
echo --- end ---
